// Cyrus web analytics, PURE half (no DB, no network, client-safe). Everything the collector decides about ONE hit from
// cyrus.my lives here so it is unit-tested without a server:
//   - which events exist, how a path / referrer / UTM is cleaned (nothing arrives in a stored row unvalidated)
//   - where a visit came from, incl. AI assistants (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini, Copilot ...)
//   - the consent rules: DNT / Global Privacy Control = nothing at all; no analytics consent = an identifier-free
//     aggregate hit (no visitor id, no session id, no partner code); analytics consent = a rotating anonymous id
//   - bots are COUNTED, never stored as events (they must not enter a human metric)
